 86SE c  States in {+86}Se populated through 4n-transfer reaction.              
 86SE c  2015Li42: E({+82}Se)=577 MeV provided by Tandem-XTU and ALPI           
 86SE2c  superconducting LINAC at INFN-Legnaro. Target=2 mg/cm{+2} thick        
 86SE3c  evaporated on 1.2 mg/cm{+2} thick Ta backing facing the beam.          
 86SE4c  Measured E|g, I|g,                                                     
 86SE5c  ({+86}Se)|g-coin, level lifetimes by recoil-distance Doppler shift     
 86SE6c  (RDDS) using Cologne Plunger device, in which a {+93}Nb degrader foil  
 86SE7c  of 4.1 mg/cm{+2} thickness was mounted downstream for slowing down the 
 86SE8c  projectile-like recoils. PRISMA magnetic spectrometer was used for mass
 86SE9c  separation using B|r-|DE-tof method, and position information of       
 86SEAc  recoils measured by micro-channel plate (MCP) detector and multiwire   
 86SEBc  parallel-plate avalanche counters (MWPPAC). The AGATA demonstrator     
 86SECc  array of five triple clusters of 36-fold segmented HPGe detectors was  
 86SEDc  used for the detection of Doppler-corrected |g-rays. Level lifetimes   
 86SEEc  were extracted from ({+86}Se)|g-coin spectra generated with a condition
 86SEFc  on total kinetic energy loss (TKEL) of recoils, the latter generated   
 86SEGc  from event-by-event analysis using relativistic two-body kinematics.   
 86SEHc  Comparison with large-scale shell model calculations using several     
 86SEIc  different effective interactions.                                      
