 86RB c  2010Ma02: The |g beam obtained from the bremsstrahlung of a 5-|mA      
 86RB2c  electron beam with various energies (uncertainty 30 keV) on a 0.5-mm   
 86RB3c  Ta disk. The activation method was used to determine the excitation    
 86RB4c  yields for the metastable states in {+86}Rb. |g rays detected with a   
 86RB5c  175-cm{+3} HPGe detector. Comparison with TALYS calculations.          
