 86SR cG RI(x)$Intensity for composite 646.4+648.0+649.0                        
 86SR cG M$From DCO ratios and linear polarization data. Evaluators consider    
 86SR2cG the electric or magnetic nature of a transition as tentative (i.e.     
 86SR3cG placed in parentheses) when value of measured polarization asymmetry   
 86SR4cG overlaps negative or positive values.                                  
 86SR cL E$From least-squares fit to E|g data                                   
 86SR cL J$As proposed in 2016Ku17 based on their DCO and POL data, band        
