 86ZR cQ $Q(|e)=1314 {I15}, S(2n)=22690 {I7}, S(2p)=11897 {I4} (2021Wa16)       
 86ZR c  {+86}Zr first identified by 1951Hy24. Later work by 1964Aw02           
 86ZR d  Yield and cross section measurements in various reactions:             
 86ZR d  2022Ta13, 2021Ba29, 2021Fo05, 2021Sh10, 2021Wi13, 2019Ba40,            
 86ZR2d  2019Na23, 2018Vo05, 2018Ya20, 2017Ya09, 2015Al19, 2015Ro11,            
 86ZR3d  2015Sz04, 2015Ta05.                                                    
 86ZR c  Theoretical structure calculations:                                    
 86ZR c  2022Bo05, 2022Bo16: calculated single particle energies using standard 
 86ZR2c  covariant density functional theory.                                   
 86ZR c  2021De33: calculated superdeformed bands within the                    
 86ZR2c  variable moment of inertia model.                                      
 86ZR c  2021Th08: calculated potential energy curves, shell closure parameters,
 86ZR2c  S(2n), root mean square radius, neutron skin thickness using density   
 86ZR3c  dependent meson exchange model DD-ME2 and density dependent point      
 86ZR4c  coupling models DD-PC1 and DD-PCX.                                     
 86ZR c  2019Ag14: calculated ground state quadrupole deformation parameter,    
 86ZR2c  high-spin states, proton and neutron pairing gaps, moments of inertia  
 86ZR3c  using cranked Hartree-Fock-Bogoliubov (CHFB) theory.                   
 86ZR c  2018Di08: calculated S(2n), rms neutron radius using resonant-continuum
 86ZR2c  relativistic mean-field plus BCS in complex momentum representation    
 86ZR3c  with the BCS approximation for pairing correlations.                   
 86ZR c  2018Mi21: calculated deformations, energies as function of intrinsic   
 86ZR2c  mass quadrupole moment, proton and neutron single particle energies,   
 86ZR3c  using axial Hartree-Fock calculations with M3Y-P6 interaction;         
 86ZR4c  discussed role of tensor force.                                        
 86ZR c  2015Bh13: calculated center-of-mass energies and potential energy      
 86ZR2c  surfaces, binding energy, root-mean-square charge radius, quadrupole   
 86ZR3c  deformation parameter |b{-2} for the ground states and selected first  
 86ZR4c  few intrinsic excited states using relativistic mean-field formalism   
 86ZR5c  with NL3 and NL3* forces.                                              
 86ZR c  2015Ku08: calculated rms radius, binding energy, deformation parameters
 86ZR2c  using relativistic (RMF) and nonrelativistic (SHF) mean-field          
 86ZR3c  formalisms with Bardeen-Cooper-Schrieffer (BCS) and Bogoliubov pairing.
 86ZR c  2014Zh43: calculated deformation parameters |b{-2} and |g using        
 86ZR2c  nonaxial deformed Woods-Saxon (WS) potential, and pairing by           
 86ZR3c  Lipkin-Nogami approach.                                                
 86ZR c  2012Zh09: calculated S(2n), neutron radius using RMF+ACCC+BCS approach 
 86ZR2c  with NLSH and NL3 effective interactions.                              
 86ZR c  2004Ca35: calculated rotational bands energies, configurations using   
 86ZR2c  cranked Nilsson-Strutinsky model.                                      
 86ZR c  2004He24: calculated ground-state deformation, radius, S(2n),          
 86ZR2c  density distributions using relativistic mean-field approach.          
 86ZR c  2003Ge10: calculated binding energy, radius, quadrupole deformation,   
 86ZR2c  pairing effects using relativistic mean field approach.                
 86ZR c  2000Ga57: calculated high-spin levels, J|p, B(E2), B(M1) using         
 86ZR2c  shell model.                                                           
 86ZR c  2000Li25: analyzed levels, J|p, superdeformed band, transition         
 86ZR2c  energies, moments of inertia.                                          
 86ZR c  1997Ar13: calculated orbital occupation probabilities; deduced         
 86ZR2c  deformation related features using statistical theory.                 
 86ZR c  1995La07: calculated binding energy, rms charge and neutron radii,     
 86ZR2c  isotope shifts, neutron skin thickness, shape coexistence, quadrupole  
 86ZR3c  deformation using relativistic mean field theory.                      
 86ZR c  1993Ch41: calculated levels, J|p, g factors, B(|l) using interacting   
 86ZR2c  boson model with inclusion of collective core.                         
 86ZR c  1993Ki04: calculated nucleon occupation numbers; deduced neutron-proton
 86ZR2c  interaction role in deformation using Hartree-Fock-Bogolyubov theory.  
 86ZR c  1993Sh09: calculated binding energy per particle, n-, p- rms radii,    
 86ZR2c  quadrupole and hexadecupole moments, point densities using relativistic
 86ZR3c  mean field model.                                                      
 86ZR c  1985Na02: calculated oblate, prolate |b{-2}, quadrupole moment using   
 86ZR2c  microscopic model with shell correction.                               
 86ZR c  1984He07: calculated potential energy versus quadrupole deformation    
 86ZR2c  using interacting boson model.                                         
 86ZR c  1983Bu09: calculated levels, J|p, backbending plots, B(E2) ratios using
 86ZR2c  interacting boson model.                                               
 86ZR c  1976Gh01: calculated gap parameter, ground state energy using          
 86ZR2c  modified random phase approximation.                                   
 86ZR c  Other theory references for structure: 43 references retrieved from    
 86ZR2c  the NSR database are listed in this dataset as 'document' records.     
