 86NB c  {+86}Nb first identified and produced by 1974Vo03. Later work by       
 86NB2c  1977Ko05, 1982De43 and 1985Wa10. A 56-s isomer was identified by       
 86NB3c  1994Sh07                                                               
 86NB c  Mass measurement: 2006Ka48                                             
 86NB c  Theoretical structure calculations:                                    
 86NB c  2004Ca35: calculated levels, J|p, rotational bands, configurations,    
 86NB2c  transition quadrupole moments using cranked Nilsson-Strutinsky model.  
 86NB c  2001Zh28: calculated level spacing distributions, chaotic features     
 86NB2c  using particle-plus-rotor model.                                       
 86NB c  Other theoretical structure references: five references in the         
 86NB2c  NSR database listed in this dataset as 'document' records.             
 86NB d  Theory (structure): 2018Bu13, 2001Zh16, 2000Ku28, 2000Ga55, 1997He24.  
