 86NB2c  array in conjunction with Microball.                                   
 86NB c  1999Co10: E=130 MeV. Measured |g-ray linear polarization with a four-  
 86NB2c  crystal Clover polarimeter, and |g(|q) with one HPGe detector.         
 86NB c  1998Ka19: E=130 MeV. Measured lifetimes of two levels using RDM.       
