 86TC c  Theoretical structure calculations:                                    
 86TC c  2019Na35: calculated pairing gaps, B(>), nuclear partition functions   
 86TC2c  using shell model.                                                     
 86TC c  2012Sa50: calculated isospin mixing effects and isospin breaking (ISB) 
 86TC2c  corrections for superallowed |b transitions from {+86}Tc decay using   
 86TC3c  density functional theory, and unitarity of the CKM matrix.            
 86TC c  2003Ba19, 2002Ba58: calculated binding energy, level energies, and     
 86TC2c  energy differences between T=0 and T=1 states using                    
 86TC3c  interacting boson model (IBM).                                         
 86TC c  2001Li39: calculated B(M1), role of quasideuteron configurations using 
 86TC2c  rotor-plus-particle model.                                             
