 86TC c  2009Ga40, 2008Ga04 (also 2007Re18): Fragmentation of {+107}Ag beam at  
 86TC2c  E=750 MeV. Particle identification through fragment recoil separator.  
 86TC3c  Search for isomers using the RISING (Rare ISotope INvestigations at    
 86TC4c  GSI) array of 15 seven-element cluster Ge detectors. The detectors     
 86TC5c  were placed in three angular rings at 51|', 90|', and 129|' with       
 86TC6c  respect to the secondary beam axis. Measured delayed |g-ray spectra.   
 86TC7c  Comparisons with shell-model calculations.                             
 86TC c  2000Ch07 (also 1997Re12): Fragmentation of {+92}Mo beam at             
 86TC2c  E=60 MeV/nucleon with a Nb target. Particle identification through     
 86TC3c  LISE3 magnetic spectrometer at GANIL facility. Search for isomers by   
 86TC4c  measuring delayed |g rays using four LEPS detectors.                   
 86TC c  All data are from 2009Ga40, unless otherwise indicated. Isospin        
 86TC2c  assignments are based on a comparison with Shell Model.                
